<title>UK: Gazprom says overallotment option used.</title>
<headline>Gazprom says overallotment option used.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Demand for the American Depositary Share issue for Russia's RAO Gazprom has resulted in the lead managers exercising an overallotment option of an additional 3.555 million ADS, Gazprom said in a statement.</p>
<p>The issue has been increased to 27.255 million ADS, each representing 10 underlying shares.</p>
<p>The initial 23.7 million ADS issue was priced on Monday at $15.75 to raise $373.3 million.</p>
<p>Including the 15 percent overallotment option, the issue will now raise $429.3 million.</p>
<p>The stabilisation period for Gazprom ADS has now ended.</p>
<p>The ADS came off $1.23 to $17.90/$18.40 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
